Just who do you take me for, huh?

518
00:33:32,920 --> 00:33:35,617
Besides, this project's
more my cup of tea anyway.

519
00:33:35,700 --> 00:33:40,260
Every minute, I inch closer to
completing my greatest work of art.

520
00:33:43,140 --> 00:33:44,600
Good to know, Lili.

521
00:33:45,240 --> 00:33:48,946
The Straw Hats are on their way
and should be arriving shortly.

522
00:33:49,900 --> 00:33:51,520
They're coming here!

523
00:33:52,680 --> 00:33:55,420
I hope to never see those losers again.

524
00:33:55,900 --> 00:33:59,040
When they're around, anything
that can go wrong will!

525
00:34:00,980 --> 00:34:05,617
The Godfather wanted me to tell you you
will be attending the meeting too, Lili.

526
00:34:05,700 --> 00:34:07,840
Oh, don't be late.

527
00:34:12,540 --> 00:34:14,480
This is a fine mess.

528
00:34:14,820 --> 00:34:16,440
I have no choice.

529
00:34:22,220 --> 00:34:23,820
Oh, Caesar.

530
00:34:24,340 --> 00:34:26,880
I'm, uh, Veggie's older half-brother.

531
00:34:28,200 --> 00:34:31,760
The name's Gangster
Gastino, you little punk.

532
00:34:35,700 --> 00:34:38,020
He's not even trying to hide it at all.

533
00:34:38,160 --> 00:34:39,660
That name is so fake.

534
00:34:40,320 --> 00:34:41,202
Really, Caesar?

535
00:34:41,560 --> 00:34:43,660
His laugh, it's still the same.

536
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:46,860
My mistake. Different
guy. Sorry about that.

537
00:34:47,060 --> 00:34:48,317
You were great, Luffy.

538
00:34:48,400 --> 00:34:50,860
That's obviously Caesar. You liar!

539
00:34:51,080 --> 00:34:52,820
I knew it had to be you.

540
00:34:53,020 --> 00:34:54,697
What are you doing here anyway?

541
00:34:54,780 --> 00:34:56,597
Do you think this is my choice?

542
00:34:56,680 --> 00:34:57,915
Use your head, dummy.

543
00:34:58,060 --> 00:35:01,097
Please don't tell me you people
forgot where you last left me.

544
00:35:01,180 --> 00:35:05,827
My only ticket out of a certain death
was to become this bozo's personal slave.

545
00:35:06,120 --> 00:35:08,002
He's holding my heart, you know.

546
00:35:08,460 --> 00:35:12,540
You better tell Trafalgar Law that
I'm gonna gut him when I see him.

547
00:35:12,740 --> 00:35:15,840
Then I'm coming for you
after. All right, enough.

548
00:35:16,240 --> 00:35:17,181
Can it, you two?

549
00:35:24,260 --> 00:35:26,280
You're wasting my precious time.

550
00:35:27,100 --> 00:35:28,260
Lay it on me.

551
00:35:29,360 --> 00:35:30,760
We gonna play nice?

552
00:35:31,180 --> 00:35:32,220
Oh, are we done?

553
00:35:40,240 --> 00:35:43,887
Let me punch you for shooting
Peckums first, then we can talk!

554
00:35:44,500 --> 00:35:45,330
Uh, Lili?

555
00:35:47,900 --> 00:35:49,140
Are you ready?

556
00:35:53,500 --> 00:35:55,200
There's no time for this!

557
00:36:02,320 --> 00:36:04,300
Put your fist down right now.

558
00:36:04,560 --> 00:36:06,600
This isn't helping the situation.

559
00:36:06,920 --> 00:36:08,820
But this jerk shot my buddy.

560
00:36:10,260 --> 00:36:13,960
How dare you speak to the
Godfather like that. Got it.

561
00:36:14,140 --> 00:36:15,537
Lower your barrel, Fall.

562
00:36:15,620 --> 00:36:18,200
Would you stop? It's okay. Let him go.

563
00:36:19,900 --> 00:36:22,080
I kicked them out already.

564
00:36:22,380 --> 00:36:23,851
Don't tell me what to do.

565
00:36:25,700 --> 00:36:27,200
Give me a break.

566
00:36:28,500 --> 00:36:29,330
Oh

567
00:36:39,300 --> 00:36:44,037
Then that one fact alone makes
us allies we may not share

568
00:36:44,120 --> 00:36:48,060
ideals or lifestyles but we
all have a common enemy here?

569
00:36:49,440 --> 00:36:51,860
Settle your differences at a later time!

570
00:36:52,720 --> 00:36:56,720
Everyone's cooperation will be
necessary for gaining the upper hand.

571
00:36:59,900 --> 00:37:00,980
What's your plan?

572
00:37:01,280 --> 00:37:03,740
I've got every last detail worked out.

573
00:37:03,880 --> 00:37:05,197
Let's get it over with.

574
00:37:05,280 --> 00:37:07,751
Then I'll be done with you fools for good.
